message: "Please cite this work using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "APSP exponent refinements: a complete Lean proof and a conditional faster bound"
authors:
  - family-names: "Wharton"
    given-names: "Joshua"
    affiliation: "QFEX"
    email: "joshua@qfex.com"
date-released: 2026-10-20
repository-code: "https://github.com/JoshuaQFEX/apsp-bound"
url: "https://github.com/JoshuaQFEX/apsp-bound"
abstract: >-
  A complete Lean proof of deterministic integer APSP in the exact challenge
  word-RAM model at exponent 2.995560766, obtained by retuning the executable
  parameters and numerical certificate of an inherited verified algorithm.
  A separate real numerical certificate and mathematical cost-ledger proof
  refine the conditional aligned-cache exponent to 2.9929479187094; the full
  machine-program theorem at that faster exponent remains unproved.
